[[File:Purple Mascot (Beta 36.1).png|thumb|262x262px|Beta 36.1]]
Purple Mascot was added in '''Beta 36.0 '''as a 6/6/6. Its first change was already in the next update, '''Beta 36.1''', where it lost 1 ATK and its secondary effect of dealing as much DMG to its owner as it just took itself (with a maximum of 6).
[[File:Purple Mascot (Beta 38.2).png|thumb|Beta 38.2]]
'''Beta 38.2''' lowered its ATK by 1 again, but now also its Cost and lowered its HP by 2, going from 6G 5/6 to 5G 4/4. It also gained a new secondary effect, a Magic effect that shows you 5 random monsters in your deck and the 1 you choose gains Taunt. '''Beta 54.0''' gave it +1 HP, removed its Taunt and reworked its Magic. This Magic now transforms a card (so either monster or spell) of your choice in your hand into a copy of a random [[:Category:Epic|Epic]] monster that you have in either your deck or dustpile.

